# GMS calls this one Opportunity and pays a 20% chance of charging two orbs at
# once. The ring is taken as full everywhere in this game, so that grant would
# be worth nothing at all -- and rather than ship a row that does nothing and
# says something else, it is renamed for the DEF it hands out instead.
#
# Which is also worth nothing, deliberately: DEF stops paying at a share of the
# attacking monster's own attack, and a Hero has passed that cap on their stats
# alone. See SkillEffect.def_pct, dead by the same design.
name: "Combo Attack - Barricade"
skill_order: 5
description: "Increases the DEF granted by each Combo Orb."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO
hyper: true
required_level: 150
max_level: 1
base { def_per_combo_orb: 100 }
